This is a Bill of Lading for a shipment of Bentonite Lumps from Kakinada Port, India to Ciwandan Port, Indonesia. The shipment is said to weigh 8000 M/Tons and is payable as per Charter Party. The number of Original Bs/L is 3 ( THREE ) and the B/L was issued on 22/04/2017 at Kakinada Port. The signature for the carrier is from Capt. AKKARAPHOL ROJJANAPORN , MASTER OF M.V. JUTHA DHAMMARAKSA .

The shipment is in good order and condition on board the vessel for carriage to the port of Discharge or so near thereto as the vessel may safely get. The carrier is not responsible for loss or damage howsoever arising.

The freight is payable as per Charter Party and the reference number for the Bill of Lading is JD / KKD - CWN / 001 . The consignee is PT BUMI KARYATAMA RAHARJA and the notify party is the same as the consignee. The goods are said to be in the port of loading and the final destination is Jakarta, Indonesia.

